一杯水），但不要让它们偏离焦点，这样就不会偷走注意力。\n- 氛围应该是:高级、轻松、真实、“Instagram值”的。\n\n4. 文本整合:\n-识别产品类别，并在空白处生成简短的手写风格或优雅的英文文本覆盖（例如，“日常必需品”、“早晨仪式”、“高级选择”）。\n-确保文字颜色与背景形成良好的对比。\n\n操作:忽略原来的白色背景。立即将该产品运送到其完美的自然栖息地。", 370866435, "randomize", "3:4", "2k", "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 65, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel", "label": "channel", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "channel"}], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "RH_Nano_Banana2_Image2Image", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for 